Package: mtgcodex.api
Type: Package
Title: Magic: The Gathering Synergy Engine and Deckbuilding API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Florian", "Ricquier", email = "florian.ricquier@mtgcodex.dev", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Florian Ricquier [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Florian Ricquier <florian.ricquier@mtgcodex.dev>
Description: A mechanics-first synergy engine and Plumber API for Magic: The
    Gathering deckbuilding. Models cards through normalized mechanical
    behaviour (produces, rewards, requires, replaces, prevents, amplifies)
    to identify synergies, score pairs bidirectionally, detect packages and
    combos, and generate decks. Includes a browser-based UI served at /ui/.
License: AGPL (>= 3)
BugReports: https://github.com/Andrameleck/mtgcodex.api/issues
URL: https://github.com/Andrameleck/mtgcodex.api
